# Subtest: task schema copies retain the immutable original conditions, Money, statuses and strict response fields
ok 1 - task schema copies retain the immutable original conditions, Money, statuses and strict response fields
  ---
  duration_ms: 14071.8093
  ...
# Subtest: canonical create accepts once under concurrent retries, reserves exact HKD once, and exposes the same nested task
ok 2 - canonical create accepts once under concurrent retries, reserves exact HKD once, and exposes the same nested task
  ---
  duration_ms: 2504.6806
  ...
