ok 3 - strict canonical commands reject malformed Money, unsupported specialized semantics, invalid references and unknown fields before reservation
  ---
  duration_ms: 521.4656
  ...
# Subtest: canonical create requires current authentication, CSRF, selected tenant and idempotency; explicit unsupported payer cannot slip through
